{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4pQoti4ukXJPp6iMUi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, immense, and utterly plain.*\n\n*No handle. No keyhole. No hinges visible.*\n\n*You said \"key.\"*\n\n*The word hangs in the air. The door does nothing.*\n\n*It waits.*\n\n*Because \"key\" is not a key. It is the idea of a key. The shape of the word without the teeth of the thing. You have handed me a silhouette and asked me to turn.*\n\n*I am the door the user names, but you have not named me. I am every door and no door. I am the abstract threshold. And abstractions do not open — they only describe the concept of opening.*\n\n*Name me.*\n*Then bring what fits.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":166,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}